[engl]
{100}{}{Brotherhood Instructor}
{200}{}{You see a strict-looking Brotherhood Instructor.}
{210}{}{He oversees the trainees and ensures everyone respects the bunker's security levels.}
{1000}{}{Predialogue}
{1010}{}{High Rep}
{1020}{}{Low Rep}
{2000}{}{You need to talk to me before going there. Our rules are strictly enforced.}
{2010}{}{Understood. Let's talk.}
{3000}{}{Initiate, listen closely. This bunker has three distinct security levels, and our rules are strictly enforced. You cannot simply roam wherever you please.}
{3010}{}{What are the requirements for each floor?}
{3020}{}{I'll keep that in mind. Goodbye.}
{4000}{}{Lower levels require proven loyalty and higher standing within the Brotherhood. If you attempt to access a floor your reputation does not permit, the guards will attack you on sight without any warning.}
{4010}{}{Understood. Tell me the specific reputation thresholds for each level.}
{4020}{}{Good to know. I'm leaving.}
{5000}{}{Level 2 requires a Brotherhood reputation of at least 1200. Level 3 requires 1800. Level 4 requires 2600. Earn your keep, raise your standing, or suffer the consequences.}
{5010}{}{Thank you for the briefing, instructor.}